  "content_blocks": [
    {
      "block_id": "b00000",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "View PDF",
      "ordinal": 0,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This part of the Procurement Journey helps you to create a Route 2 Commodity/Service strategy.",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "A Commodity/Service strategy should not be confused with a Procurement Strategy . Further information on Procurement Strategy requirements can be found in the Additional Resources section.",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Develop Strategy Templates",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "To aid creating your Commodity/Service strategy, templates are provided at the bottom of this page:",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "The Business Case template provides headings (with accompanying descriptions) to include when seeking approval for your project.",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "The Commodity - Service strategy is a checklist of the areas which you may include in your strategy.",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "A Develop Strategy template is provided for your use. You do not need to use all of the elements contained in this template for your strategy: use the areas which are relevant to your specific procurement exercise.",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "You will find additional Commodity/Service Strategy guidance and templates in Route 3 which you may find useful when looking at higher risk or value Route 2 procurement exercises. However you only need to follow Route 3 where the contract’s estimated value is at or above the threshold values. More information is available on threshold values including how to calculate your contract's estimated value to determine if it meets the thresholds .",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "If you are unable to estimate the value of a contract that contract will be explicitly made subject to the procurement rules.",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00010",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Any economic, social and environmental opportunities should be included in your strategy when they are relevant and proportionate. You can use the Sustainable Procurement Tools to help develop your strategy.",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00011",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Contracts Register",
      "ordinal": 11,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00012",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "When developing your commodity/service strategy, you should access the contracts register for your organisation. This will assist in evaluating existing contract arrangements, including contract value.",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00013",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The Contracts Register module in Public Contracts Scotland (PCS) provides the facility for buying organisations to operate a register of all contracts they have in place. A public register of contracts meets the obligations of Section 35 of the Procurement Reform Act (Scotland) 2014 .",
      "ordinal": 13,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00014",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Quickfire Guide",
      "ordinal": 14,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00015",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Contracts Register Hints & Tips",
      "ordinal": 15,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Contracts Register Hints & Tips"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00016",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The PCS contracts register will pull through the contract value from the contract award notice. You should always be open and transparent when completing the contract value field. This field can be manually amended but all relevant amendments need to be manually duplicated in the Scottish Procurement Information Hub: there is no integration between the two systems.",
      "ordinal": 16,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Contracts Register Hints & Tips"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00017",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "An organisation may withhold information from the publication of the contract award or the conclusion of the framework agreement. This is when the release of the information:",
      "ordinal": 17,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Contracts Register Hints & Tips"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00018",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "(a) would impede law enforcement or be contrary to the public interest;",
      "ordinal": 18,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Contracts Register Hints & Tips"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00019",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "(b) would prejudice the commercial interests of any person;",
      "ordinal": 19,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Contracts Register Hints & Tips"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00020",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "(c) might prejudice fair competition between economic operators.",
      "ordinal": 20,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Contracts Register Hints & Tips"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00021",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "So, if relying on (b) above, you would need to be able to demonstrate that the commercial interests of the person concerned would definitely be prejudiced by the release of this information.",
      "ordinal": 21,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Contracts Register Hints & Tips"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00022",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "PLEASE NOTE: if you do not use PCS for producing a contract register, you must produce a publicly available one.",
      "ordinal": 22,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Contracts Register Hints & Tips"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00023",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "When a Commodity/Service Strategy is prepared it should be proportionate to:",
      "ordinal": 23,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Contracts Register Hints & Tips"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00024",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "risk",
      "ordinal": 24,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Contracts Register Hints & Tips"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00025",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "value and",
      "ordinal": 25,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Contracts Register Hints & Tips"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00026",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "the strategic importance of the commodity/service to your organisation.",
      "ordinal": 26,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Contracts Register Hints & Tips"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00027",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Sign Off Points",
      "ordinal": 27,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Sign Off Points"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00028",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "There are natural break points within the Procurement Journey that can be used as review points for sign off and approval to proceed to the next stage of the process.",
      "ordinal": 28,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Sign Off Points"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00029",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Suggested review and sign off points are:",
      "ordinal": 29,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Sign Off Points"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00030",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "At project initiation",
      "ordinal": 30,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Sign Off Points"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00031",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "After initial opportunity assessment",
      "ordinal": 31,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Sign Off Points"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00032",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "For approval of the strategy including budget",
      "ordinal": 32,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Sign Off Points"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00033",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "For approval of Contract Notice, Selection Stage and/or ITT",
      "ordinal": 33,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Sign Off Points"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00034",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "At Contract Award stage",
      "ordinal": 34,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Sign Off Points"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00035",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "At implementation stage",
      "ordinal": 35,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Sign Off Points"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00036",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Throughout the Journey you will see reference to these sign off points at the relevant sections, as well as documents/templates for your use.",
      "ordinal": 36,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Sign Off Points"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00037",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Consideration must also be given to Planning , Sustainable Procurement and Risk Management throughout this stage of the Journey.",
      "ordinal": 37,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Sign Off Points"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00038",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Once you have completed your Commodity/Service strategy, you should continue your Journey.",
      "ordinal": 38,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Sign Off Points"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00039",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Sustainable Procurement",
      "ordinal": 39,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Sign Off Points",
        "Sustainable Procurement"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00040",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The Sustainable Procurement Duty , outlined in the Procurement Reform (Scotland) Act 2014 , requires you to think about how you can:",
      "ordinal": 40,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Sign Off Points",
        "Sustainable Procurement"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00041",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "improve the social, environmental and economic wellbeing in the areas in which you operate, whether nationally or more locally. Particular focus should be on reducing inequality",
      "ordinal": 41,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Sign Off Points",
        "Sustainable Procurement"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00042",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "facilitate the involvement of small and medium enterprises, third sector bodies and supported businesses in the procurement process",
      "ordinal": 42,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Sign Off Points",
        "Sustainable Procurement"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00043",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "promote innovation",
      "ordinal": 43,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Sign Off Points",
        "Sustainable Procurement"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00044",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "You can create a positive environmental impact through every procurement exercise you undertake, regardless of its value or scope. This should be a key part of commodity/service profiling and strategy development rather than an optional area of interest. You must fully explore the possibilities with your User Intelligence Group and other stakeholders for your procurement.",
      "ordinal": 44,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Sign Off Points",
        "Sustainable Procurement"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00045",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Full Sustainable Procurement guidance can be found the Sustainable Procurement Station in Route 3.",
      "ordinal": 45,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Sign Off Points",
        "Sustainable Procurement"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00046",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "What if You Don’t Use PCS to Publish Your Contract Register?",
      "ordinal": 46,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Sign Off Points",
        "What if You Don’t Use PCS to Publish Your Contract Register?"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00047",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "PLEASE NOTE: if you do not use PCS for producing a contract register, you must still produce a publicly available one.",
      "ordinal": 47,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Sign Off Points",
        "What if You Don’t Use PCS to Publish Your Contract Register?"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00048",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "risk,",
      "ordinal": 48,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Sign Off Points",
        "What if You Don’t Use PCS to Publish Your Contract Register?"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00049",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "What if You Use PCS-Tender?",
      "ordinal": 49,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Sign Off Points",
        "What if You Use PCS-Tender?"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00050",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "If using PCS-Tender , the buyer should upload the appropriate slide s to the appropriate task within PCS-Tender.",
      "ordinal": 50,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Sign Off Points",
        "What if You Use PCS-Tender?"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00051",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Data Protection",
      "ordinal": 51,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Sign Off Points",
        "Data Protection"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00052",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Organisations should determine if data processing activities are relevant to the procurement exercise.",
      "ordinal": 52,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Sign Off Points",
        "Data Protection"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00053",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Your contracts may be subject to Data Protection legislation .",
      "ordinal": 53,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Sign Off Points",
        "Data Protection"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00054",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Organisations must ensure:",
      "ordinal": 54,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Sign Off Points",
        "Data Protection"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00055",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "current and future procurement exercises are compliant with Data Protection. This includes contracts that began before the legislation came into force",
      "ordinal": 55,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Sign Off Points",
        "Data Protection"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00056",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "All relevant procurement documents make reference to the current legislation.",
      "ordinal": 56,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Sign Off Points",
        "Data Protection"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00057",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "More detailed information can be found in the Data Protection station within Additional Resources .",
      "ordinal": 57,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Sign Off Points",
        "Data Protection"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00058",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Freedom of Information",
      "ordinal": 58,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Sign Off Points",
        "Freedom of Information"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00059",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Please note that if you withhold the contract value from a contract award notice this information may still be requested from your organisation via the Freedom Of Information (Scotland) Act 2002 (FOISA) .",
      "ordinal": 59,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Sign Off Points",
        "Freedom of Information"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00060",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The FOISA equivalent test is set much higher than the Contracts Register i.e:",
      "ordinal": 60,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Sign Off Points",
        "Freedom of Information"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00061",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "publication would have to, or be likely to cause substantial prejudice",
      "ordinal": 61,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Sign Off Points",
        "Freedom of Information"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00062",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "the impact to public interest in withholding the information would have to outweigh the public interest in releasing it.",
      "ordinal": 62,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Sign Off Points",
        "Freedom of Information"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00063",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Detailed contracts register user guidance can be found in PCS .",
      "ordinal": 63,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Sign Off Points",
        "Freedom of Information"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00064",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Care and Support Services",
      "ordinal": 64,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Sign Off Points",
        "Care and Support Services"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00065",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "For Care and Support Services procurements, the buyer must use Route 3 Develop Strategy stations and sub-stations to develop their service strategy and plan their approach to the procurement. You should then progress Route 2 from the Develop Documents station.",
      "ordinal": 65,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Sign Off Points",
        "Care and Support Services"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00066",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Cyber Security",
      "ordinal": 66,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Sign Off Points",
        "Cyber Security"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00067",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Cyber Risks",
      "ordinal": 67,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Sign Off Points",
        "Cyber Security"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00068",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "If the contract will involve, support or rely on the digital processing of information, organisations should ensure that appropriate consideration is given to potential cyber risks and their management.",
      "ordinal": 68,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Sign Off Points",
        "Cyber Security"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00069",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Further information on how to assess and manage cyber risks as part of the procurement process can be found in the Scottish public sector Guidance Note on Supplier Cyber Security Buyers should assess cyber risks and develop appropriate cyber security requirements as part of award criteria.",
      "ordinal": 69,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Sign Off Points",
        "Cyber Security"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00070",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Any documents you need are listed below",
      "ordinal": 70,
      "heading_path": [
        "Develop Strategy Templates",
        "Contracts Register",
        "Any documents you need are listed below"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
